Rule 7 (If clip_value_min is scalar, its value should be less than or equal to the maximum of clip_value_max)
{t : tensor, clip_value_min : tensor, clip_value_max : tensor} |= if ndim(clip_value_min) = 0 then min(clip_value_min) ≤ max(clip_value_max)
