Rule 8 (If clip_value_max is scalar, its value should be greater than or equal to the minimum of clip_value_min)
{t : tensor, clip_value_min : tensor, clip_value_max : tensor} |= if ndim(clip_value_max) = 0 then max(clip_value_max) ≥ min(clip_value_min)
